## Provenance

Approximately 24 seed facts (the fee structure, the `PAY_001`–`PAY_003` error
codes, plan-tier names, payout timing, and the fraud-scoring product name) derive
from `data/sample_kb.txt` in the author's earlier `llm-support-agent` project.
That material is also the author's own work and is relicensed here under CC BY 4.0.

Everything else — the document structure, the front matter, the distractors, the
multi-hop chains, the version history, and roughly 95% of the prose — was written
new for this repository. See `docs/source-project-audit.md` §16 for the full
reuse decision and its reasoning.
